<title>USA: NGC says Reyser to be president of Destec.</title>
<headline>NGC says Reyser to be president of Destec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>NGC Corp said Dan Ryser will be appointed president and chief operating officer of Destec Energy Inc, effective on the close of NGC's purchase of Destec.</p>
<p>NGC is buying Destec in a stock purchase agreement that was announced February 18, NGC said in a statement.  Closing of the purchase is expected by the end of the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Ryser formerly headed NGC affiliate Electric Clearinghouse Inc, NGC said.</p>
<p>NGC also said Charlie Goff, Destec's chairman and chief executive officer, will stay on with the company after the purchase in an advisory role to assist with the transition process.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk +1 212 859 1627))</p>
